"period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1396009/000162828026009546/vmc-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Vulcan Materials Company operates primarily in the U.S. and is the nation's largest supplier of construction aggregates (mainly crushed stone, sand and gravel) and a major producer of aggregates-intensive downstream products such as asphalt mix and ready-mixed concrete. Delivered by trucks, ships, barges and trains, we provide the materials needed for the infrastructure that maintains and expands the U.S. economy. Our products are essential for building homes, offices, data centers, places of worship, schools, hospitals and factories, as well as vital infrastructure including highways, bridges, roads, ports and harbors, water systems, campuses, dams, airports and rail networks. During the year ended December 31, 2025, we had 425 active aggregates facilities as shown below.","zh":"Vulcan Materials Company 主要在美國運營，是美國最大的建築骨材（主要是碎石、沙子和礫石）供應商，也是瀝青混合料和預拌混凝土等骨材密集型下游產品的主要生產商。我們透過卡車、船舶、駁船和火車運送，提供維持和擴大美國經濟的基礎設施所需的材料。我們的產品對於建造住宅、辦公室、資料中心、禮拜場所、學校、醫院和工廠以及高速公路、橋樑、道路、港口和港口、供水系統、校園、水壩、機場和鐵路網等重要基礎設施至關重要。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度，我們擁有 425 個活躍的聚合設施，如下所示。"},{"en":"Production and sales are currently halted at our Calica operations in Mexico and our Puerto Cort s operations in Honduras. For additional information regarding our Calica operations, see Note 12 \"Commitments and Contingencies\" in Item 8 \"Financial Statements and Supplementary Data.\"","zh":"我們位於墨西哥的卡利卡工廠和位於宏都拉斯的科爾特港工廠目前已停止生產和銷售。有關 Calica 業務的更多資訊，請參閱第 8 項“財務報表和補充數據”中的附註 12“承諾和或有事項”。"},{"en":"Additionally, we further serve our customers through our 71 asphalt facilities and 76 concrete facilities located in Alabama, Arizona, California, Maryland, New Mexico, Tennessee, Texas, Virginia, the U.S. Virgin Islands and Washington D.C.","zh":"此外，我們還透過位於阿拉巴馬州、亞利桑那州、加利福尼亞州、馬裡蘭州、新墨西哥州、田納西州、德克薩斯州、維吉尼亞州、美屬維京群島和華盛頓特區的 71 個瀝青設施和 76 個混凝土設施進一步為客戶提供服務。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"No material part of our business depends upon any single customer whose loss would have a significant adverse effect on our business. In 2025, our five largest customers accounted for approximately 7% of our total revenues, and no single customer accounted for more than 2% of our total revenues. Although approximately 40% to 55% of our aggregates shipments have historically been used in publicly-funded construction, such as highways, airports and government buildings, a relatively small portion of our sales are made directly to federal, state, county or municipal governments/agencies. Therefore, although reductions in state and federal funding can curtail publicly-funded construction, the vast majority of our business is not directly subject to renegotiation of profits or termination of contracts with local, state or federal governments. In addition, our sales to government entities span","zh":"我們業務的任何重要部分都不依賴任何單一客戶，其損失將對我們的業務產生重大不利影響。 2025年，我們的五個最大客戶約占我們總收入的7%，沒有單一客戶占我們總收入的2%以上。儘管我們約 40% 至 55% 的骨料發貨歷來用於公共資助的建設，例如高速公路、機場和政府大樓，但我們的銷售中相對較小的一部分直接銷售給聯邦、州、縣或市政府/機構。因此，儘管州和聯邦資金的減少可能會減少公共資助的建設，但我們的絕大多數業務並不直接受到與地方、州或聯邦政府重新談判利潤或終止合約的影響。此外，我們向政府實體的銷售涵蓋"},{"en":"As an industry leader, we are and always have been committed to environmental stewardship which is necessary for our long-term sustainability and growth. Production of construction aggregates requires land, energy and water. Efficient use of these resources and management of the environmental impacts of our operations are embedded in our business planning and lead to increased operational efficiency, cost reduction, new opportunities for growth and effective risk management.","zh":"作為行業領導者，我們始終致力於環境管理，這對於我們的長期永續發展和成長至關重要。建築骨材的生產需要土地、能源和水。有效利用這些資源以及管理我們營運對環境的影響已納入我們的業務規劃中，從而提高營運效率、降低成本、帶來新的成長機會和有效的風險管理。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Aggregates","val":6297200000,"zh":"骨材"},{"name":"Asphalt","val":1294400000,"zh":"瀝青"},{"name":"Concrete","val":846600000,"zh":"具體的"}],"total":7941100000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Revenue Excluding Freight Delivery","val":6932800000,"zh":"不包括貨運的收入"},{"name":"Service","val":313700000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":7941100000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":7926200000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Gulf Coast","val":3687700000,"zh":"墨西哥灣沿岸"},{"name":"East","val":2452700000,"zh":"東方"},{"name":"West","val":2297800000,"zh":"西方"}],"total":7941100000}},"peers":["MLM","URI","MAS","EXP","SHW"]}}